{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"infernal_juggernaut","model_identifier":"infernal_juggernaut","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# infernal_juggernaut\n\nInfernal juggernaut (C2), breaker, 4 m = 142 u to the chimney tops (hunched back 124 u).\n\nA hunched, enormously heavy siege beast: red cracked demon flesh under black iron plates (visor, neck plate, chest, back hump, pauldrons, gauntlets, thigh/knee plates, greaves) with rivets, a furnace glowing through an iron grille in its chest (glow_furnace), two short horns, a fanged maw under the visor, orange-yellow eye slits, and two smoking chimneys on its back (`fx_smoke_1`, `fx_smoke_2`). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled).\n\n- Cubes: 41 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -63.0..63.0, y 0.0..140.0, z -37.8..24.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 110 x 128 x 60 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 2.2 | loop | footfalls at 0 and 1.1 s (camera shake / dust) |\n| `run` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `attack_smash` | 2.4 | once | key 1.3 s: both gauntlets smash down in front (also its wall attack) |\n| `aggro` | 2.2 | once | rears up and pounds the air |\n| `injured` | 0.8 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 2.4 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 2.2 s, 70.4 u per cycle (heavy stomping walk)\n- `run`: 71.1 u/s (2.00 m/s), cycle 1.4 s, 99.6 u per cycle (lumbering)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.3 s: both gauntlets smash down in front (also its wall attack)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 121, -28)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 90.5, 21.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (16, 101, 21.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (27.5, 113.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 85, -21.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (48, 37, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-59.5, 65, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-48, 37, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (24, 59, 13.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-24, 59, 13.5)\n- `fx_smoke_1` on `torso` at (-14, 141, 12)\n- `fx_smoke_2` on `torso` at (12, 137, 12)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_furnace are the lit cubes.\n- `fx_smoke_1` / `fx_smoke_2`: chimney tops, emit smoke (on the torso bone).\n"},"description":"# infernal_juggernaut\n\nInfernal juggernaut (C2), breaker, 4 m = 142 u to the chimney tops (hunched back 124 u).\n\nA hunched, enormously heavy siege beast: red cracked demon flesh under black iron plates (visor, neck plate, chest, back hump, pauldrons, gauntlets, thigh/knee plates, greaves) with rivets, a furnace glowing through an iron grille in its chest (glow_furnace), two short horns, a fanged maw under the visor, orange-yellow eye slits, and two smoking chimneys on its back (`fx_smoke_1`, `fx_smoke_2`). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled).\n\n- Cubes: 41 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -63.0..63.0, y 0.0..140.0, z -37.8..24.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 110 x 128 x 60 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 2.2 | loop | footfalls at 0 and 1.1 s (camera shake / dust) |\n| `run` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `attack_smash` | 2.4 | once | key 1.3 s: both gauntlets smash down in front (also its wall attack) |\n| `aggro` | 2.2 | once | rears up and pounds the air |\n| `injured` | 0.8 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 2.4 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 2.2 s, 70.4 u per cycle (heavy stomping walk)\n- `run`: 71.1 u/s (2.00 m/s), cycle 1.4 s, 99.6 u per cycle (lumbering)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.3 s: both gauntlets smash down in front (also its wall attack)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 121, -28)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 90.5, 21.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (16, 101, 21.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (27.5, 113.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 85, -21.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (48, 37, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-59.5, 65, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-48, 37, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (24, 59, 13.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-24, 59, 13.5)\n- `fx_smoke_1` on `torso` at (-14, 141, 12)\n- `fx_smoke_2` on `torso` at (12, 137, 12)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_furnace are the lit cubes.\n- `fx_smoke_1` / `fx_smoke_2`: chimney tops, emit smoke (on the torso bone).\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-23.0,56.0,-14.0],"to":[23.0,66.0,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,56.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[100,401,146.0,411.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[192,401,220.0,411.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[146,401,192.0,411.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[220,401,248.0,411.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[120,158,166.0,186.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[166,158,212.0,186.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"707f9da5-5e44-50a5-b63b-457fc4b68696"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-38.0,66.0,-20.0],"to":[38.0,112.0,20.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.